config BR2_PACKAGE_POP_CURSOR_THEME
	bool "pop-cursor-theme"
	help
	  The Pop mouse cursors (from Pop!_OS's icon theme), the
	  cursors COSMIC is designed with, installed as the system
	  default cursor theme (/usr/share/icons/default), and Pop's
	  symbolic icons (scalable/, 2.3 MB), which COSMIC's icon
	  theme inherits for the icons it does not draw. Pop's
	  fixed-size PNG icons are not installed.

	  https://github.com/pop-os/icon-theme
